API RULES
==================================================

API standards:
- RESTful architecture
- Consistent naming
- Proper status codes
- Structured error responses

Always return:
{
  success: boolean,
  message: string,
  data?: any,
  error?: any
}

Use:
- 200 OK
- 201 Created
- 400 Bad Request
- 401 Unauthorized
- 403 Forbidden
- 404 Not Found
- 500 Server Error

